# on the VM, published tracks, verified lap times, bug tickets, site
# statistics and live ghost rooms. Installed into /etc/systemd/system by
# deploy/vm/deploy-board.sh. Its secrets (BUGS_TOKEN, BOARD_ADMIN_TOKEN,
# BOARD_SESSION_SECRET, BOARD_ADMINS) are in /etc/fdfpv/board.env (root,
# mode 600), made by deploy-board.sh the first time and never in a
# repository.
